{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"港鐵跟進東涌西站承建商責任問題\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/MTR-REPLY-261109-21.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】港鐵表示，正向東涌西站承建商跟進月台支柱施工質量問題，有關失誤、處理情況以及責任問題，亦待承建商提交報告及補救方案。</p><p>港鐵表示，非常重視鐵路項目的監管和工程質素，會持續巡查並採取監督措施，確保項目質素，亦會配合政府部門徹查事件，並就成因、補救方案以及與承建商的跟進行動，按時提交報告。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T13:43:49.167406+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":150,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T13:09:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T17:17:46.383616+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T13:37:25.950286+00:00","content_hash":"bee9735d085d3c16c70f6a78a15d116a61c0dab287ad12949ff1aeee5bed26a9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T13:43:49.167406+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}